OL,3,GNEWSAMadi's last Christmas wish
OL,4,Ainspires hospice appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old hospice patient who
OL,7,Fcelebrated Christmas in May, weeks
OL,8,Fbefore her death, has inspired a
OL,9,Ffestive appeal at the site that cared
OL,10,Ffor her.
OL,12,FMadi Foster from Stafford fought
OL,13,Fadrenocortical carcinoma for three
OL,14,Fyears, raising thousands of pounds for
OL,15,Flife-lengthening treatment abroad.
OL,17,FShe spent her final weeks in Katharine
OL,18,FHouse Hospice, where staff in May
OL,19,Fhelped her decorate her room, cooked a
OL,20,FChristmas dinner, and dressed up to
OL,21,Fjoin her family and friends in festive
OL,22,Fgames.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
